## BUILD NOTES
- The build is phased. Implement only the phase you are asked to.
- Charts may use Recharts; no other heavy dependencies.
- Everything must work offline with mock data.
- Do not use real brand logos, copyrighted imagery, or fabricated real-world addresses.
